- id: '2097014127965487151'
  text: 'Not one and done.


    The first pass rushed into a full build before the proportions worked. More detail
    wasn''t the answer.


    Lessons from the first exercise (VANTA) became a reusable skill: compare orthographic
    views, fix the weak part, preserve what works. But it wasn''t innate - a lot of
    coaching was still required to get Astra to focus on doing things correctly.


    A process, not a magic prompt.


    3/7'
